The {{Term/Store|Gerudo Secret Club||Series, BotW, TotK}},{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="Greta">{{Cite|This is the {{Color BotW|Blue|Gerudo Secret Club}}, or {{Color BotW|Blue|GSC}} for short.|Greta|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|This is the {{Color TotK|Red|Gerudo Secret Club}}, a secret place that sells clothing designed with voe in mind.|Greta|TotK}}</ref> also known as the '''GSC''',{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="Greta"/> is a recurring secret [[Shop]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
The Gerudo Secret Club is a hidden [[Shop]] run by [[Greta]] in [[Gerudo Town]], located in the building behind the [[Fashion Passion]] [[Armor Shop]]. Despite the fact that it is illegal to sell men's clothing in Gerudo Town, the Gerudo Secret Club sells the [[Desert Voe Set]] and [[Radiant Set]], since there is a demand for such [[Armor]].<ref>{{Cite|This is the only shop in Gerudo Town where someone could buy clothes meant for a voe to wear. Despite it being illegal to sell voe clothing in this town, there is a high demand for such things.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> The Club is also the only place in Gerudo Town where [[Link]] can remove the [[Gerudo Outfit]] without being kicked out, since Greta is able to tell he is a man and does not care.<ref>{{Cite|I've never seen a voe disguise himself as a vai like you have, though... We each have something to hide, I suppose. Let's ignore that and move on the business.|Greta|BotW}}</ref>

If Link tries to enter the Gerudo Secret Club through the door at Fashion Passion, [[Saula]] will stop him from doing so, instead quietly directing him to the side door if he is a member.<ref>{{Cite|Ah, um, that doorway isn't for customers, actually... {{Small|If you're a member, please head around to the door on the side.}}|Saula|BotW}}</ref> When he first tries to use the side door, Greta will ask him for a password.<ref>{{Cite|...What's the password?|Greta|BotW}}</ref> This starts "[[The Secret Club's Secret]]" [[Side Quest]]. At [[The Noble Canteen]], Link is able to overhear [[Yaido]] share the Club's password, which is "GSC♦".<ref>{{Cite|Oh, that's right, the password! It's {{Color BotW|Red|GSC♦}}. I overheard Saula talking about it, so I'm sure that's right!|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> Upon hearing the correct password, Greta will allow Link to enter the Shop.<ref>{{Cite|All right... You can come in.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> When Link does so, she notices that she has not seen him before and welcomes him as a member.<ref>{{Cite|Hey... I haven't seen your face around here before... Hmm... Heh heh heh... Looks like we've got ourselves a rare visitor. I guess I have a suspicious mind... So maybe you don't ask too many questions, and I won't either. You're a member here now, so thanks for your patronage.|Greta|BotW}}</ref>

Whenever Link makes a purchase from the Gerudo Secret Club, Greta will thank him and promise to restock the Armor piece soon.<ref>{{Cite|Sarqso.|Greta|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Sarqso. I recommend pairing it with other clothing items from this series.|Greta|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Hahaha...sarqso. I'll make sure to restock for you.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> She may also instruct Link to take care of his new Armor, since it is a precious item.<ref>{{Cite|Sarqso. It's a precious item, so be sure to take good care of it.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> When Link leaves the Shop after buying all of its Armor, Greta will not be surprised.<ref>{{Cite|[I should be going.] Time to go, is it? I'm not surprised. You've bought everything I have.|Greta|BotW}}</ref>

